			"notes": "Day 1 Patches:\n- Made `above_bottom` and `below_top` values of numerous placed features not affected by height changes\n> Designer Note: this should fix placed features escaping containment.\n- Rebalanced some Ore Distribution\n> Designer Note: With the changes to the height limits of the Nether, this caused an unintentional side effect of ores being harder to find, so some ores have their numbers tweaked. For Ancient Debris, the trapezoid used in the placement has its plateau set to y=-48.\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/glacialvitality/more-nether/compare/2027.0...2027.0.1"
